# Teamio prototype app rules

- Import UI only from `@teamio/starter/*` (Vite alias to `../teamio-prototype-starter/src`).
- Import styles via `@teamio/starter/styles/global.css` only — no new CSS modules or local design tokens.
- Keep Tailwind on starter theme (`tm-` prefix); do not invent a parallel theme.
- Do not add reusable UI components here — add them in `teamio-prototype-starter`, then import.
- Keep structure as `src/pages/`, `src/router/`, `src/data/` for screens, routing, and fixtures.
- Prefer composing starter primitives (`PageTemplate`, `Typography`, forms, table, etc.) over custom markup styled from scratch.
